# Dependencies
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated 3D sources. These are the raw Trellis / Hunyuan3D outputs at 2048px
# and ~40-100k triangles, plus the sci-fi asset pack the Chicago work replaced.
# Together they are ~860 MB, which does not belong in a git repo on any plan.
#
# They ARE regenerable: art/images/props_chicago holds every reference image and
# art/prompts/chicago_prompts.json every prompt, so
#   python tools/hunyuan.py --batch art/images/props_chicago art/raw_glb/chicago_v2
# rebuilds the lot at roughly 150 s of GPU time each. The decimated, textured
# results that the game actually ships are committed in the Unity project.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
art/raw_glb/
art/poc_src/

# Capture and audit output, all regenerable
tools/shots/
tools/reports/
shots/

# Build and scratch
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
